However, the implementation here sets both SO_SNDTIMEO (0x1005) and SO_RCVTIMEO (0x1006) when setSoTimeout is called. This means writes also get a timeout. The write path returns 0 on EAGAIN and retries indefinitely. That's a potential hangs, but not part of the reported issue. I'll leave the write path as-is to avoid over-reaching and potentially breaking other tests.

